OL,3,GNEWSACouncil says cracking road to stay
OL,4,Ashut until 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key road between two communities in
OL,7,FGloucestershire will remain closed
OL,8,Funtil next year following a major
OL,9,Flandslip three years ago.
OL,11,FGloucestershire County Council
OL,12,Finstalled temporary traffic lights on
OL,13,Fthe B4234 Forest Road in November 2023
OL,14,Fwhile work was carried out on the road
OL,15,Fwhich connects Whitecroft and Lydney in
OL,16,Fthe Forest of Dean.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
