OL,3,GNEWSACouncil says cracking road to stay
OL,4,Ashut until 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council shut the road fully in
OL,7,FFebruary to allow for work at the
OL,8,Flandslip site and it announced on
OL,9,FWednesday that the closure would be
OL,10,Fextended to summer 2027 because parts
OL,11,Fof the road were cracking and have
OL,12,Fsubsidence.
OL,14,FNearby businesses said they had lost
OL,15,Fmoney as a result of the road closure.
